{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CH","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"歷代志上","commonName":"歷代志上","title":"歷代志上","order":13,"numberOfChapters":29,"sha256":"2f94c34a21c96afb2fa5dd31e916ecbe47a93a65b505dad02727f81d295816f4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":29,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/29.json","totalNumberOfVerses":938},"chapter":{"number":14,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["大衛的宮殿和家人"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["泰爾王希蘭差遣使者帶著香柏木、木匠和石匠去為大衛建造宮殿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["那時，大衛知道耶和華已立他做以色列王，並因祂以色列子民的緣故而使他國家興旺。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["大衛在耶路撒冷又娶了多位妻子，生了更多兒女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["他在耶路撒冷生的孩子有沙姆亞、朔罷、拿單、所羅門、"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["益轄、以利書亞、以法列、"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["挪迦、尼斐、雅非亞、"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["以利沙瑪、比利雅大和以利法列。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["打敗非利士人"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["非利士人聽說大衛已被膏立為以色列王，就全軍出動，搜尋大衛。大衛聽說後，便出來迎敵。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["非利士人前來襲擊利乏音谷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["大衛求問上帝：「我可以去迎戰非利士人嗎？你會把他們交在我手裡嗎？」耶和華說：「去吧，我必把他們交在你手裡。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["於是，大衛前往巴力·毗拉心，在那裡打敗了他們。他說：「上帝藉我的手擊潰敵人，如洪水沖垮堤岸。」因此那地方叫巴力·毗拉心",{"noteId":8},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["非利士人在那裡丟棄了他們的神像，大衛命人把它們燒掉。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["非利士人又來襲擊那山谷，"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["大衛又求問上帝，上帝對他說：「你不要正面追擊他們，要繞到他們後面，從桑林對面攻打他們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["你一聽見桑樹梢上響起腳步聲，就要進攻，因為那表示上帝已在你前頭去攻擊非利士的軍隊了。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["大衛遵命而行，打敗非利士軍隊，從基遍一直殺到基色。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["於是，大衛名揚列國，耶和華使列國都懼怕他。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":8,"caller":"+","text":"「巴力·毗拉心」意思是「沖垮之主」。","reference":{"chapter":14,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/14.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/15.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/13.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}